    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_QyvcYmzKvEoSHKmq",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Here&apos;s what nobody tells you: You&apos;re not addicted to nicotine. You&apos;re addicted to the RITUAL. <strong>The hand-to-mouth motion</strong>. The breathing pattern. The throat sensation. Nicotine leaves your system in 72 hours, but the ritual? That&apos;s what keeps you trapped for YEARS. Lio gives your brain the exact same ritual satisfaction while your body naturally detoxes.</h3>"
