    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_UObeJQW26H8AFCD0",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3><strong>Impossible</strong>. Lio contains zero addictive substances - no nicotine, no chemicals, just natural wood and food-grade flavors. Users naturally reduce usage over 2-4 weeks as new habits form. It&apos;s designed as a bridge to complete freedom, not a new dependency. Think of it like training wheels, you don&apos;t stay on them forever.</h3>"
