      "id": "text_MF7fvzBrTf4ImkF8",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Is Lio safe? What are the ingredients?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_BTlLOkY7U3Mlwgca",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Absolutely safe. Premium olive wood with natural essential oils. That&apos;s it.</h3><h3>Third-party lab tested. Zero nicotine, zero chemicals, zero batteries, zero combustion. You could literally eat the ingredients and be fine. Compare that to the 7,000+ chemicals in cigarettes or the unknown long-term effects of vaping. This is literally the safest thing you could put in your mouth.</h3><h3></h3><h3>Made from food-grade ingredients that have been used safely for centuries. No synthetic additives, no artificial flavors, no hidden substances. Use it anywhere, planes, offices, restaurants. No restrictions because there&apos;s nothing harmful to restrict.</h3><h3>Your health stays protected while your cravings get satisfied.</h3>"
    },
