      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3><strong>We ship from UAE, so delivery is fast and local</strong>. Free shipping to your door. Most orders arrive within 1-2 business days across the Emirates.</h3><h3></h3><h3>We&apos;re actually working on 10-minute deliveries (not kidding), but we&apos;re not there yet. Soon though.</h3><h3></h3><h3><strong>If after 30 days it doesn&apos;t work for you, we&apos;ll organize pickup and return.</strong> You don&apos;t lift a finger, we handle everything and give you a full refund.</h3><h3></h3><h3>No shipping fees. No return fees. No hassle.</h3><h3>Order today, try it this week, decide next month. Everything is handled for you.</h3>"
