    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_fyVRYK31py8QNwQa",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3><strong>The device itself lasts years</strong>. Premium wood doesn&apos;t break down like plastic vapes or need battery replacements.</h3><h3></h3><h3><strong>Each flavor core lasts 1-3 days with regular use</strong>. Think of it like a tea bag, you inhale the natural oils until the flavor fades, then swap in a fresh core.</h3><h3></h3><h3><strong>Your Journey Pack includes 18 cores, giving you 60 days of use.</strong> After that, you just order refill cores, they&apos;re much cheaper than your current habit.</h3><h3></h3><h3>The wood device is built to last. The cores are consumed and replaced. Your freedom is permanent.</h3>"
    },
