      "default": "<h3>The menthol cores provide the throat hit you&apos;re used to, while the inhalation mimics your exact breathing patterns. You still hold it, inhale, and exhale just like before. Your brain gets the sensory satisfaction it craves, but without harmful chemicals entering your body.</h3>"
