    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_iC9PJxaWEILoZifu",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3><strong>Expensive compared to what?</strong></h3><h3></h3><h3>Your cigarettes: €8-12 daily </h3><h3>Your vaping: €50-80 monthly </h3><h3><strong>Lio: €49 once</strong></h3><h3></h3><h3>You spend more on your addiction in 3 days than Lio costs for 2+ months.</h3><h3></h3><h3><strong>You&apos;re not buying wood for €49.</strong> You&apos;re buying back €3600+ yearly, your lung capacity, and relationships not strained by smell and health fears.</h3><h3></h3><h3>The expensive choice is paying thousands yearly for slow self-destruction. </h3><h3></h3><h3><strong>€49 to potentially save thousands and regain your health, that&apos;s the investment of a lifetime. Plus 30-day guarantee. Full refund if it doesn&apos;t work.</strong></h3>"
