    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_ONbCAaug9Fc8ZTTX",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>How is this different from other methodes?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_hPSVrsR8WCwLVSOU",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Patches and gums only address the 30% chemical addiction. Lio is the first solution to tackle the 70% behavioral addiction, the hand ritual, breathing patterns, and sensory memories that keep you trapped. It&apos;s not a \"better\" nicotine replacement, it&apos;s a completely different approach.</h3>"
